{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/anta/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"never-stop-spirit","title":"永不止步的品牌精神","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/anta/culture-and-values/never-stop-spirit","wordCount":2035,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"jinjiang-to-global","title":"从晋江到全球的进取文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/anta/culture-and-values/jinjiang-to-global","wordCount":2302,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-brand-culture","title":"多品牌文化融合管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/anta/culture-and-values/multi-brand-culture","wordCount":2456,"readingTime":10},{"seq":4,"slug":"mission-vision-values","title":"安踏使命愿景价值观体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/anta/culture-and-values/mission-vision-values","wordCount":1924,"readingTime":8},{"seq":5,"slug":"ding-shizhong-leadership","title":"丁世忠创始人领导力解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/anta/culture-and-values/ding-shizhong-leadership","wordCount":2029,"readingTime":9},{"seq":6,"slug":"multi-brand-culture-deep","title":"多品牌文化差异管理深度解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/anta/culture-and-values/multi-brand-culture-deep","wordCount":2102,"readingTime":9},{"seq":7,"slug":"chinese-sportswear-ambition","title":"中国运动品牌全球化雄心","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/anta/culture-and-values/chinese-sportswear-ambition","wordCount":2166,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"# 文化与价值观 简介\n\n安踏的企业文化是其三十年持续增长的核心驱动力。从创始人丁世忠背着鞋子在北京推销的草根故事，到\"永不止步\"成为中国最知名的体育品牌口号之一，安踏的文化基因深刻塑造了这家企业的组织行为和战略选择。\n\n本章内容概览：\n\n**永不止步的品牌精神**系统解析这一核心理念从广告语到企业信仰的演进过程，分析它如何渗透到组织的每一个决策层面，以及在不同发展阶段的内涵变迁。\n\n**从晋江到全球的进取文化**追溯安踏文化的地域根源——闽南商人\"爱拼才会赢\"的精神底色，分析这种草根进取文化如何支撑企业从区域品牌走向全球化集团。\n\n**多品牌文化融合管理**探讨安踏在收购 FILA、始祖鸟（Amer Sports）等国际品牌后，如何处理不同品牌文化之间的张力，建立\"各美其美\"的多元文化共存机制。\n\n学习建议：建议先理解\"永不止步\"的精神内核，再追溯其文化源头，最后研究多品牌时代的文化治理挑战，形成从单一到多元的认知递进。\n"}